OL,3,GNEWSAWhatsApp scam warning issued after
OL,4,Aspike in reports
OL,5,
OL,6,FA spike in reports of "convincing"
OL,7,Fscammers using WhatsApp to try and dupe
OL,8,Fpeople into sharing their financial
OL,9,Finformation has prompted a police
OL,10,Fwarning.
OL,12,FNottinghamshire Police said they had
OL,13,Frecently seen an increase in fraudsters
OL,14,Fusing the app to impersonate banks and
OL,15,Fthe Financial Conduct Authority (FCA).
OL,17,FDetectives said the criminals had been
OL,18,Fusing messages as well as audio and
OL,19,Fvideo calls to impersonate a "trusted
OL,20,Fauthority".
